app ui-castle-board "1.0.0"
"Castle build-and-defend siege: thin organism composing the std-tactics-board-2d frame + std-score, plus three organism-level traits (CastleClock / CastleEconomy / CastleWaves) that turn the turn-based frame into a real-time siege — a 2s clock auto-advances turns, workers harvest gold at the mines, gold raises watchtowers on the mine plots, and raider waves stream out of a boxed war portal down the north corridor. Win by destroying the portal and every raider; lose when the whole garrison, keep included, is wiped."
;; @capabilities "castle building, defense gameplay, wave siege, sprite-animated combat"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: SERA, castellan of Emberhold, holding a walled 9x9 isometric
;; keep against a war portal in the north wall: workers mine gold, gold
;; raises watchtowers, raider waves stream down the corridor.
;; Statuses: scripted playthrough done (68/70 checks); verdicts inline below.
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a castle build-and-defend player expects): FORTIFY, then
;; SURVIVE. Play is continuous — a 2-second clock advances the round on its
;; own: your spent defenders refresh and the raiders act whether or not you
;; touched anything. The economy is the engine: workers standing at the gold
;; mines harvest every cycle, you stockpile, and you spend 25 gold to raise a
;; watchtower on a mine plot — towers are both fortification and garrison
;; (they strike like any defender). Pressure escalates: while the war portal
;; stands, a raider wave musters at the corridor mouth every ~12 seconds,
;; each one tougher than the last, and they walk straight at your garrison
;; and batter whatever they reach for 1 per cycle. The portal is FULLY boxed
;; by the curtain wall (all 5 in-bounds neighbor cells impassable, diagonals
;; included — the enemy AI steps diagonally), so it holds position as a spawn
;; fortress and can only be shelled from the corridor mouth at range 2. You
;; win by destroying the portal (which stops the waves) and mopping up every
;; raider; you lose when your whole garrison — guardians, workers, towers,
;; AND the keep — is wiped. A fight looks like: select a guardian -> green
;; reach cells -> move -> the guardian STAYS selected and auto-arms (red
;; cells = enemies in range 2) -> strike for 3 -> the guardian is SPENT
;; until the next clock tick. The hardcoded "End Turn" button stays as a
;; manual round-hurry; the clock makes it optional.
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; SERA — "I fortify Emberhold, hold the corridor, and smash the war portal
;; before its waves smash my keep."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see the whole stronghold framed on screen — the
;;      stone curtain ring, the grass courtyard, the plank corridor running
;;      from the north gate past the keep to the south gate, my four
;;      guardians and two workers garrisoned inside, the gold mines flanking
;;      the corridor, the war portal boxed into the north wall, and the HUD
;;      showing Result/Phase/Turn/Score/Gold/Wave.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — 8 units placed, 81 tiles (55 stone/20 grass/6 planks),
;;        HUD shows Result/Phase/Turn/Score/Gold/Wave, CDN sprite descriptors,
;;        5 ground-anchored features (run7 s1, 7/7 checks).
;;   2. Every unit on the board is a visible sprite with a name label and a
;;      health bar I can read at a glance, idling in place — guardian,
;;      worker, keep, watchtower, raider and portal art all visually
;;      distinct.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — idle frames cycle, health bars full, guardian /
;;        worker / keep / portal sprite stems visually distinct. Caveat:
;;        spawned raider/watchtower render via manifest fallback with an
;;        EMPTY name label (substrate gap: the SPAWN effect sets no name).
;;   3. Play is continuous: the Turn counter advances about every 2 seconds
;;      WITHOUT me clicking End Turn, and a unit I spent last cycle is fresh
;;      again on the next. The End Turn button still works as a manual hurry.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — Turn 2->6 in ~4.6s with zero input, END_TURN +
;;        AI_TURN on the bus, a spent sheller strikes again the next cycle.
;;   4. My workers harvest: while a living worker stands on or next to a
;;      gold mine (manhattan <= 1), Gold rises every clock cycle; with no
;;      worker at either mine it does not.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — gold 24->28 with workers parked at the mines;
;;        frozen at 54->54 with workers off-mine; resumed 56->60 on return.
;;   5. With 25+ gold I hit "Tower (25g)" and a watchtower rises on the
;;      first free mine plot (west mine first, then east); my gold drops by
;;      25. Under 25 gold — or with both plots occupied — the button is a
;;      dead click (guard).
;;        STATUS: WORKS — west tower on (2,2): gold 25->8 + SPAWN +
;;        watchtower.svg rendered; dead click under 25 gold; east tower on
;;        (6,2); both plots occupied -> dead click, gold kept (run2 s5).
;;   6. Raider waves: about every 12 seconds, WHILE THE PORTAL STANDS, a
;;      raider musters at the corridor mouth (4,2) with scaling health
;;      (6 + wave number) and engages my line on the next clock ticks. If
;;      the muster cell is occupied the wave waits for it to clear. Killing
;;      the portal stops the reinforcements — then I only have to mop up.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — waves on 12s ticks, hp 6/7/8/9 scaling; a raider
;;        parked on the muster cell blocked the 48s tick (no raider4, wave
;;        stayed 3), un-parking resumed spawns; after portal death + free
;;        muster, a 13s window produced zero raider SPAWN.
;;   7. Combat: I select a guardian (green reach), move (walk animation, one
;;      move per cycle), it auto-arms (red = enemies within range 2), and I
;;      strike for 3 — the guardian is then spent until the next tick. A
;;      raider that reaches my line batters the adjacent defender for 1 per
;;      cycle.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — green set exactly (3,3)(4,3)(3,4) with wall (3,1)
;;        unlit, phase=selection; walk animation; move to (4,2) auto-arms
;;        red [(4,0)]; strike 1.00->0.50 frac (3 dmg); BURST "-3"; hit.svg;
;;        attacker dimmed 0.45; spent re-click dead; a pinned raider batters
;;        for -1/cycle (g1 to 6/10, fx-ai on the bus).
;;   8. The war portal is FULLY boxed by the curtain wall: the AI can never
;;      step it (all 5 in-bounds neighbor cells impassable, diagonals
;;      included — the AI steps diagonally), so it holds position as a spawn
;;      fortress — and my defenders destroy it by shelling over the wall
;;      from the corridor mouth at range 2.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — portal never left (4,0) in any run; shelled from
;;        (4,2) at range 2 (-0.10 frac per strike x9) and destroyed.
;;   9. The keep is my last bastion: raiders that break the garrison walk to
;;      it and batter it. When my whole garrison — guardians, workers,
;;      towers, AND the keep — is dead, Result flips to defeat and the board
;;      freezes.
;;        STATUS: BROKEN — two idle runs (302s and 603s) never reached
;;        defeat (result=none, keep >=22/24, garrison barely dented):
;;        substrate gap in std-grid-tactics AI — the greedy diagonal step
;;        has no occupied-cell fallback, so raiders freeze at diagonal
;;        range and the wipe stalls permanently (compounded by the
;;        catalog's dual-runtime state divergence).
;;  10. When the portal and every raider are dead, I win — Result flips to
;;      victory and the board freezes (the portal's death stops the waves,
;;      so the mop-up is finite). Kills tick Score +10.
;;        STATUS: WORKS — result=victory (turn 53, gold 202, wave 4),
;;        GAME_END on the bus, post-game click dead (frozen board). Score
;;        +10/kill but read 50 for 4 kills: one kill double-counted via
;;        doubled UNITS_CHANGED on the shared bus (substrate dual-runtime
;;        duplication, not an organism bug).
;;
;; MULTIPLAYER NOTE: GameState is [runtime, shared], so every connected
;; client watches the same siege on the same frame; intents serialize
;; through the server authority. There is no per-seat ownership — any
;; client can drive any player unit.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/, generated by tools/asset-workflow
;; svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/stone.svg curtain-wall cubes (impassable);
;;             terrain/grass.svg courtyard; terrain/planks.svg corridor +
;;             south gate.
;;   Units     units/{guardian,worker,keep,watchtower,portal,raider}.svg +
;;             animation frames .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1, attack-0, hit-0,
;;             death-0}.svg; the frame molecule url-rewrites name.svg ->
;;             name.<anim>-<i>.svg. Spawned towers/raiders (SPAWN carries no
;;             modelUrl) render via the assetManifest.units[unitType]
;;             fallback with an empty name label (known atom gap).
;;             player: g1 Aldric guardian 10hp (3,2) corridor mouth
;;                     g2 Berta guardian 10hp (5,2) corridor mouth
;;                     g3 Cedric guardian 10hp (2,4) keep flank
;;                     g4 Dagna guardian 10hp (6,4) keep flank
;;                     w1 Pick worker 6hp (2,3) at the west mine
;;                     w2 Shovel worker 6hp (6,3) at the east mine
;;                     keep Emberhold keep 24hp (4,4)
;;             enemy:  portal War Portal 30hp (4,0), fully walled
;;   Features  features/gold_mine.svg at (2,2) and (6,2) — the harvest
;;             anchors and tower plots; features/wall.svg x3 at (3,1),(4,1),
;;             (5,1) boxing the portal (all matching tiles passable: false).
;;   Effects   effects/hit.svg (BURST "hit" fx), effects/explosion.svg
;;             (manifest-only).
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg = game-shell background + HUD panel.
;; ============================================================================

orbital CastleBoardOrbital {
  uses Frame from "std/behaviors/std-tactics-board-2d"
  uses Score from "std/behaviors/std-score"

  type Asset = {
    url : asset
    atlas : asset
    sprite : string
    role : string
    category : string
    animations : [string]
    style : string
    dimension : string
    aspect : string
    name : string
    thumbnailUrl : string
  }
  type Unit = {
    id : string!
    position : { x : number!  y : number! }
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    team : string
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    unitType : string
    name : string
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type Tile = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    passable : boolean
    terrainSprite : Asset
  }
  type Fx = {
    id : string!
    type : string!
    x : number!
    z : number
    y : number
    message : string
    ttl : number!
  }
  type ValidMove = { x : number!  z : number! }
  type Feature = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    type : string
    assetUrl : Asset
    color : string
    elevation : number
  }
  type AssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }

  entity GameState [runtime, shared] {
    id : string!
    units : [Unit] = [ { id: "g1", position: { x: 3, y: 2 }, x: 3, y: 2, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Aldric", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g2", position: { x: 5, y: 2 }, x: 5, y: 2, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Berta", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g3", position: { x: 2, y: 4 }, x: 2, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Cedric", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g4", position: { x: 6, y: 4 }, x: 6, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Dagna", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "w1", position: { x: 2, y: 3 }, x: 2, y: 3, z: 0, team: "player", health: 6, maxHealth: 6, unitType: "worker", name: "Pick", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/worker.svg", role: "npc", category: "worker", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "worker", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "w2", position: { x: 6, y: 3 }, x: 6, y: 3, z: 0, team: "player", health: 6, maxHealth: 6, unitType: "worker", name: "Shovel", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/worker.svg", role: "npc", category: "worker", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "worker", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "keep", position: { x: 4, y: 4 }, x: 4, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 24, maxHealth: 24, unitType: "keep", name: "Emberhold", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/keep.svg", role: "npc", category: "keep", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "keep", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "portal", position: { x: 4, y: 0 }, x: 4, y: 0, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 30, maxHealth: 30, unitType: "portal", name: "War Portal", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/portal.svg", role: "npc", category: "portal", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "portal", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
    fx : [Fx] = []
    tiles : [Tile] = [ { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-6-0", x: 6, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-7-0", x: 7, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-0", x: 8, y: 0, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-6-1", x: 6, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-7-1", x: 7, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-1", x: 8, y: 1, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-2", x: 6, y: 2, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-2", x: 7, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-2", x: 8, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-3", x: 6, y: 3, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-3", x: 7, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-3", x: 8, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-4", x: 6, y: 4, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-4", x: 7, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-4", x: 8, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-5", x: 6, y: 5, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-5", x: 7, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-5", x: 8, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-6", x: 0, y: 6, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-6", x: 1, y: 6, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-6", x: 2, y: 6, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-6", x: 3, y: 6, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-6", x: 4, y: 6, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-6", x: 5, y: 6, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-6", x: 6, y: 6, terrain: "grass", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-6", x: 7, y: 6, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-6", x: 8, y: 6, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-7", x: 0, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-7", x: 1, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-7", x: 2, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-7", x: 3, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-7", x: 4, y: 7, terrain: "planks", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-7", x: 5, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-6-7", x: 6, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-7-7", x: 7, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-7", x: 8, y: 7, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-8", x: 0, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-8", x: 1, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-2-8", x: 2, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-3-8", x: 3, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-8", x: 4, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-5-8", x: 5, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-6-8", x: 6, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-7-8", x: 7, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false }, { id: "t-8-8", x: 8, y: 8, terrain: "stone", passable: false } ]
    result : string = "none"
    selectedUnitId : string = ""
    validMoves : [ValidMove] = []
    attackTargets : [ValidMove] = []
    movedIds : [string] = []
    actedIds : [string] = []
    uiPhase : string = "observation"
    turn : number = 0
    score : number = 0
    scoreBaseline : number = 0
    gold : number = 0
    ecoSpawnCount : number = 0
    waveCount : number = 0
    clockTicks : number = 0
  }

  trait Authority = Frame.traits.TacticsAuthority -> GameState {
    config {
      running: true
      gridWidth: 9
      gridHeight: 9
      attackDamage: 3
      units: [ { id: "g1", position: { x: 3, y: 2 }, x: 3, y: 2, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Aldric", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g2", position: { x: 5, y: 2 }, x: 5, y: 2, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Berta", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g3", position: { x: 2, y: 4 }, x: 2, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Cedric", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "g4", position: { x: 6, y: 4 }, x: 6, y: 4, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "guardian", name: "Dagna", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/guardian.svg", role: "npc", category: "guardian", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "guardian", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "w1", position: { x: 2, y: 3 }, x: 2, y: 3, z: 0, team: "player", health: 6, maxHealth: 6, unitType: "worker", name: "Pick", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-castle-board/svg/isometric/units/worker.svg", role: "npc", category: "worker", animations: ["idle","walk","atta